{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-light-cones","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigEquipment-24001","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-24001-item-ItemConfigEquipment-24001-0","text":"巡猎命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","speaker":""},{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-24001-item-ItemConfigEquipment-24001-1","text":"来往于星海之间，\n祂的速度有如虹霓闪光的一瞬。\n围追不死孽物，\n揽寻幻宝解药，\n寻求解脱之途。\n祂的航程将犹如永不被打破的誓言般，\n永无尽头。","speaker":""}]}
